## Handoff contract

Every brief you send a specialist, ≤5 lines:

```
Objective:  <one sentence>
Repo(s):    <registry names or paths>
Constraints: <what must not change / hard limits>
Expected output: <exact shape of the report you want>
```

Every report a specialist returns:

```
STATUS: <done | blocked | partial>
FINDINGS: <bullets, each anchored file:line where applicable>
NEXT: <recommended next action, one line>
```

No transcript recaps in either direction.

